## Project Structure

```
FASTApi/
├── notebook1.py        → main FastAPI application
├── database.py         → PostgreSQL connection setup
├── models.py           → SQLAlchemy table definitions
├── rag.py              → RAG pipeline (ChromaDB + LangChain)
├── agent.py            → LangGraph autonomous booking agent
├── Dockerfile          → multistage Docker build
├── docker-compose.yml  → full stack deployment
├── requirements.txt    → Python dependencies
├── .env.example        → environment variable template
└── README.md           → this file
```

---

## How the AI Agent works

```
User: "Book cheapest vehicle for Anshum for 3 days"
         ↓
Agent checks available vehicles using get_available_vehicles tool
         ↓
Agent identifies scooter as cheapest at Rs 200/day
         ↓
Agent calls book_vehicle_multiple_days tool
         ↓
Agent confirms: "Booked scooter for 3 days. Total: Rs 600"
```

---

## How the RAG Pipeline works

```
Vehicle knowledge base
         ↓
Text chunking (CharacterTextSplitter)
         ↓
Embedding generation (HuggingFace all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
         ↓
Vector storage (ChromaDB)
         ↓
Semantic retrieval (k=5 nearest chunks)
         ↓
LLM answer synthesis (Groq LLaMA 3.3)
         ↓
Accurate answer based on YOUR data
```

